cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its outputs, please cite both the software
  and the publications listed under references.
title: "TiMSA — Tidal Inundation Model of Shallow-water Availability"
abstract: >-
  A bathtub inundation model that computes, per grid cell, how much time a
  location spends within a given depth of water over a tidal year, for
  quantifying time-integrated shallow-water habitat availability.
type: software
